# Local data. Everything under data/ is generated at runtime, with two
# deliberate exceptions committed so a fresh clone opens on a worked example
# instead of an empty screen: the sample workbook, and the database holding
# its finished report.
data/*
!data/sample/
!data/app.db
data/*.db-journal
data/*.db-wal
data/*.db-shm
